    <briefdescription>
<para>Enhanced RAII Handles for GPU Resources — Automatic Lifecycle Management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides type-safe RAII wrappers for GPU resources with automatic cleanup, move semantics, and exception safety. Prevents:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Memory leaks (RAII automatic cleanup)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Use-after-free (move-only semantics)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Double-free (moved-from state tracking)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resource exhaustion (bounded lifetimes)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-08-18 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="test__gpu__training__loop_8cpp_1af47983e44c7b4c07e44229aedf03c895" kindref="member">Batch</ref> A-9 GPU Safety Hardening </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
